n of the adaptive logic associated with the cloth CT3. d.2 Physical Phenomenon: OPE22: Error in programming of protection or control elements. The company CGE Transmission S.A. referred the background requested by Resolution Exenta 30989- 2019 for the indicated Physical Phenomenon. d.3 Reiteration: Reiteration Physical Phenomenon in the affected installation: This installation has not been affected by the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 mobile months. Reiteration Physical Phenomenon in installations of the same owner: There have been failures in installations of the same owner with the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 602/2024\n\u201cDesconexi\u00f3n forzada de barra N\u00b03 15 kV de S/E Chiguayante\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 21-01-2025\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 30/12/2024\nHora 00:55\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 4.60\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 9914.78\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.046 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n S/E Chiguayante / SE035T0058\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n Subestaci\u00f3n\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 66/15 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n Zonal\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Ar\u00edstides Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco N\u00b05561, piso 16, las Condes, Santiago, Chile\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento afectado L\u00f3gica adaptativa del pa\u00f1o CT3 de S/E Chiguayante /\nPA605T0058SE035T0058\nPropietario elemento fallado CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Ar\u00edstides Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco N\u00b05561, piso 16, las Condes, Santiago, Chile\nd.1 Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo la desconexi\u00f3n forzada de la barra N\u00b03 15 kV de S/E Chiguayante por la operaci\u00f3n de\nsobrecorriente residual del pa\u00f1o CT3, ante una falla ocurrida en la red de distribuci\u00f3n del pa\u00f1o C4,\nambos pa\u00f1os de la mencionada S/E.\nLa empresa CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A. se\u00f1ala que la causa se debe a la incorrecta implementaci\u00f3n de la\nl\u00f3gica adaptativa asociada al pa\u00f1o CT3.\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico:\nOPE22: Error en programaci\u00f3n de elementos de protecci\u00f3n o control.\nLa empresa CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A. remiti\u00f3 los antecedentes solicitados por la Resoluci\u00f3n Exenta 30989-\n2019 para el Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico indicado.\nd.3 Reiteraci\u00f3n:\nReiteraci\u00f3n Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico en la ins","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"analysis","s":0.01},{"w":"eaf","s":-0.04},{"w":"2024","s":-0.04},{"w":"forced","s":0.39},{"w":"bar","s":1.0},{"w":"disconnection","s":0.07},{"w":"15","s":0.09},{"w":"kv","s":0.07},{"w":"date","s":-0.07},{"w":"description","s":-0.06},{"w":"date","s":-0.07},{"w":"time","s":-0.08},{"w":"failure","s":-0.13},{"w":"date","s":-0.07},{"w":"30","s":0.26},{"w":"12","s":-0.12},{"w":"2024","s":-0.04},{"w":"time","s":-0.08},{"w":"00","s":-0.33},{"w":"consumption","s":0.02},{"w":"mw","s":0.04},{"w":"prior","s":-0.05},{"w":"mw","s":0.04},{"w":"percentage","s":-0.06},{"w":"disconnection","s":0.07}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"busbar_fault","display_pred":"BUSBAR FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.0058,"breaker_fault":0.4306,"transformer_fault":0.0535,"busbar_fault":0.5101},"confidence":0.5101,"correct":true},"quorum":{"pred":"breaker_fault","display_pred":"BREAKER FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.2044,"breaker_fault":0.3518,"transformer_fault":0.1536,"busbar_fault":0.2901},"confidence":0.3518,"correct":false},"nexus":{"pred":"breaker_fault","display_pred":"BREAKER FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.2467,"breaker_fault":0.4534,"transformer_fault":0.0816,"busbar_fault":0.